 "text": "Hi, how are things with you? Easy fix. Would you rather make something edible they can't resist, or something useful they'll actually use? It is doable, though it needs proper cooling. A slow cooking method is easier than instant one. Roughly one scoop of chocolate, about two tablespoons of butter or coconut oil, one cup of liquid, and a pinch of salt. Blend the chocolate and butter or oil until smooth, then add the liquid in a little at a time. Pour it into a tray lined with baking paper.",
